Bottom line
The reference UI's biggest lesson for MeatSoko isn't its colours, cards or animations. It's clarity.
MeatSoko currently tells users "here is our enormous marketplace."
The improved experience should tell them:
"Here's what you can buy, why you can trust us, and exactly how to get it."
That should be the direction for the next UX iteration. (233kfm-byu3su3jo-arcedawebapps1.vercel.app)

